nMasterldl : the company did not confirm lay off number\n\n102976240 OP  Masterldl : So far these numbers came from online info about laid off employees who spread internal email. May be it will recover? the damage is done. someone sold $60 Call options a few says before this crash.\n\n75746312\nOct 28 06:56\ni know not to catch knives and yet i continue to do it lol. f\n1\n4\n\nIzzs : Same here hahaha\n\nBroke MoneyMaker : with this drastic a drop, it’s worth some risk to grab some shares imo.\n\n中坚的艾比 : I also took the position\n\n76259075 : i joined at 48 before market open\n\nRead more\nMarket Insights\nStar Tech Companies\nFeatured Tech Stocks represent leading technology companies with strong market presence, influential in their industries, and notable for robust innovation and profitability. These firms are market leaders, significantly affecting the tech sector and broader economy.\nNo.\nSymbol\n5D % Chg\nDisney\nDIS\n+9.09%\nNetflix\nNFLX\n+7.10%\nMicrosoft\nMSFT\n+4.67%\n4\nAmazon\nAMZN\n+4.49%\n5\nAlibaba\nBABA\n+4.29%\nSign up to unlock\nView More\nEarnings Season\nWarren Buffett Portfolio\nBuffett's holdings are the latest portfolio from Berkshire Hathaway. Regarded as a top investor, his trades often signal the market and influence the industry.\nNo.\nSymbol\n20D % Chg\nMoody's\nMCO\n+17.51%\nMasterCard\nMA\n+18.18%\nVisa\nV\n+17.33%\n4\nThe Kraft Heinz\nKHC\n+15.74%\n5\nThe Kroger Co.\nKR\n+16.41%\nLog In for the Full List\nView More\n\n- No more -",
